\item \code{verbose = 1}: Pearson chi-squared test
\item \code{verbose = 2} (default): additionally the G-test (log likelihood
ratio) and the Mantel-Haenszel chi-squared test, and the point
estimates of the first three association measures
\item \code{verbose = 3}: the full table of nominal and ordinal association
measures with confidence intervals (Cramér's V, contingency
